# matrix.env - consumed by apps/ai/tuwunel via secretGenerator (the
# hermes/librechat pattern). TUWUNEL_* envs OVERRIDE the ConfigMap
# toml (upstream: env vars change config values on the fly).
# TUWUNEL_REGISTRATION_TOKEN: gates account creation while
# TUWUNEL_ALLOW_REGISTRATION is true - without a token, upstream
# demands the
# ..._yes_i_am_very_very_sure_i_want_an_open_registration_server...
# escape hatch (correctly refused posture).
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# TUWUNEL_ALLOW_REGISTRATION: true for FIRST BOOT only (D11): register
# @john FIRST (= admin via grant_admin_to_first_user), then the @hermes
# bot, then flip to false + make apply-ai. Family members later: flip
# back to true briefly, or use the admin-room user commands.
# The bot's MATRIX_* keys are NOT here and never will be: they live in
# Hermes's OWN /srv/appdata/hermes/.env (H2/C1 lesson: that store WINS
# over k8s env) - see operations.md "Matrix ops" go-live step 5.
TUWUNEL_ALLOW_REGISTRATION=true
TUWUNEL_REGISTRATION_TOKEN=CHANGEME
